{"authored" [{"question" "q-318971" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Suppose $|\\,r\\,|=10$ and the angle between vectors $r$ and $s$ is $\\theta =\\frac{2\\pi }{3}.$ Find the scalar projection of $r$ onto $s.$\n\n${\\text{comp}}_{s}\\,r=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965088/state.json" "file_sha256" "3fffea451a819647cab98429e526789880fb1f7c85cb6c6904836215f7a554e2" "basis" 656 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965088/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-318971" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the formula for the scalar projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{s}\\,r & =|\\,r\\,|\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =10cos\\,(\\frac{2\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =10\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965088/state.json" "file_sha256" "3fffea451a819647cab98429e526789880fb1f7c85cb6c6904836215f7a554e2" "basis" 656 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965088/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-318971" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965088/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "063df9d32c7b7bbea1e614df42642d34cda64b6b0566b4034b16eb743f7d8016" "basis" 656 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965088/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-318971" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965088/state.json" "file_sha256" "3fffea451a819647cab98429e526789880fb1f7c85cb6c6904836215f7a554e2" "basis" 656 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965088/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-318971" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-5"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965088/state.json" "file_sha256" "3fffea451a819647cab98429e526789880fb1f7c85cb6c6904836215f7a554e2" "basis" 656 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965088/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-18374" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the formula for the scalar projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{q}\\,p & =\\frac{p\\cdot q}{|\\,q\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{p}_{x}{q}_{x}+{p}_{y}{q}_{y}+{p}_{z}{q}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{q}_{x}^{2}+{q}_{y}^{2}+{q}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{8}+1\\cdot (-\\sqrt{3})+(-1)\\cdot 1}{\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{8})^{2}+(-\\sqrt{3})^{2}+{1}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3-\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{12}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3-\\sqrt{3}}{2\\sqrt{3}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}-1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965088/state.json" "file_sha256" "3fffea451a819647cab98429e526789880fb1f7c85cb6c6904836215f7a554e2" "basis" 656 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965088/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-18374" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965088/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "063df9d32c7b7bbea1e614df42642d34cda64b6b0566b4034b16eb743f7d8016" "basis" 656 "verification" "/home/jake/Deve